### Go template
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Root-level redisx / demo binary outputs from `go build` in repo root
/redisx
/demo

# Binary outputs from building a cmd directly (e.g. `cd cmd/redisx && go build`)
/cmd/redisx/redisx
/cmd/redisx/demo
/cmd/redisx/internal/demo/demo
/cmd/redisx/internal/demo/redisx

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool
*.out
coverage.out
coverage.txt

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Env & tooling
.env
.idea/
.trae/

# Local SQLite / storage artifacts (never commit the embedded DB)
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal

# Local-only docs / patches (project-specific broad patterns go below)
*.patch
*.html
fr/*.md
